+/* prepare_mem_pstate divides the unassigned budget by two, then divides its
+ * stack share by two again. Four fudge areas plus the overflow reserve give
+ * every restored context a nonzero bounded first-entry allowance. These are
+ * VM-free sections, not startup grant intervals charged as assigned. */
